x1lk8kvjo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div><div><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-lastupdated\">13 Dec 2025</span></p></div><div data-testid=\"liverpool-article\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260427-074339-4d487e3684-web-3.2.0-4/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 600px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/56c1/live/828d0fd0-d863-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.png.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/56c1/live/828d0fd0-d863-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.png.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/56c1/live/828d0fd0-d863-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.png.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/56c1/live/828d0fd0-d863-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.png.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/56c1/live/828d0fd0-d863-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.png.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/56c1/live/828d0fd0-d863-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.png.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/56c1/live/828d0fd0-d863-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.png.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/56c1/live/828d0fd0-d863-11f0-aae2-2191c0e48a3b.png.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Angry Ginge wears a beanie woolly hat covering his ginger hair. He is smiling and wearing warm clothing. People are behind him at the football club, also wrapped up warm.\"></p></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">I'll never forget my roots, says Angry Ginge</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">The content creator is back coaching at his football club after being crowned King of the Jungle.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-lastupdated\">13 Dec 2025</span></p></div></div></div></a></div></div></div>",
